":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","color":"447744","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-01-13T06:29:14Z","updated_at":"2026-02-27T12:39:28Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.5.1\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.1.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 6700 XT (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.21013.1000) - AMD Ryzen 5 3600 6-Core Processor (12 threads) - 31.93 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen the color picker has closed, it should not undo the changes when you press the Escape key to unfocus the node.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Select a node that has a color field\n2. Click into the input, change the value\n3. Press Enter to close the picker\n4. Press Escape to deselect the node\n5. Redo it again because the editor undoes the change \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nThe popup doesn't show in the video, but this one:\n\n<img width=\"356\" height=\"658\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1083be2e-fb51-4678-aff9-6e5293de314a\" />\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1eb79081-196e-4d76-bf5b-e4e4ee09c4bd","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114909/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine